<h1>Privacy Policy – Black Eagle Dog Management</h1>
<p><em>Last updated: 19 November 2026</em></p>
<p>Black Eagle Surveillance ("we", "us") provides the Black Eagle Dog Management mobile app and web portal. This policy explains what information the app uses and how it is protected.</p>

<h3>Information the app handles</h3>
<ul>
<li><b>Account details:</b> your name, email address, phone number, company and role, and your password (stored only in hashed form on our server).</li>
<li><b>Business records you enter:</b> dogs and their photos, health and vaccination records, breeding records, dog training records, customers and customer companies, invoices, payments and expenses.</li>
<li><b>Technical data:</b> device type, app version and error logs, used only to keep the service working.</li>
</ul>

<h3>How we use it</h3>
<p>To provide the app's features to you and your organisation, to keep accounts secure, to send invoices and notifications you request (email or WhatsApp), and to fix problems. We do <b>not</b> sell your data and we do not show advertising.</p>

<h3>Permissions</h3>
<ul>
<li><b>Internet:</b> to talk to your organisation's Black Eagle server.</li>
<li><b>Camera / photos (only when you choose to add a photo):</b> to attach pictures of dogs or payment proof.</li>
</ul>

<h3>Storage and security</h3>
<p>Data is sent over HTTPS and stored on our servers and encrypted cloud storage. Your sign-in token is kept in the device's secure storage. Each organisation can only see its own data, and what each user can do depends on the permissions their administrator gives them.</p>

<h3>Sharing</h3>
<p>Your data is shared only within your organisation, with the service providers needed to run the service (hosting, cloud storage, email and WhatsApp delivery), or where the law requires it.</p>

<h3>Retention and deletion</h3>
<p>Data is kept while your account is active. To have your account or personal data deleted, email us at the address below and we will respond within 30 days. Business records such as invoices may be kept where the law requires.</p>

<h3>Children</h3>
<p>The app is for business use and is not directed at children under 13.</p>

<h3>Changes</h3>
<p>We will post any change to this policy on this page.</p>

<h3>Contact</h3>
<p>Black Eagle Surveillance, Harare, Zimbabwe<br>Email: <a href="mailto:support@blackeaglesurveillance.co.zw">support&#64;blackeaglesurveillance.co.zw</a></p>
